@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
title 004 匯出結果：組件圖（概念層）

actor 老師
component "老師端畫面" as TeacherUI

package "搶答系統（伺服器）" {
  component "匯出入口\n(Export Gateway)" as Gateway
  component "Guided Notes 寫入\n(Guided Notes Writer)" as Writer
  component "CSV 產生\n(CSV Builder)" as Csv
  component "結果彙整（003）" as Result
  component "題目庫（002）\n原檔與空格位置" as Bank
  component "活動階段管理（001）" as Phase
}

老師 --> TeacherUI
TeacherUI --> Gateway : 匯出 Guided Notes／匯出 CSV
Gateway --> Phase : 檢查老師身分與「已結束」
Gateway --> Writer
Gateway --> Csv
Writer --> Bank : 取得原檔副本與空格位置
Writer --> Result : 取得各題搶答成功答案
Csv --> Result : 取得所有作答與順位
Writer --> Gateway : 已填答案的試算表檔
Csv --> Gateway : CSV 檔
Gateway --> TeacherUI : 下載檔案

note right of Writer
  只改填空格；
  位置來自匯入時的紀錄，
  不使用固定儲存格位置
end note
@enduml
